8209 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The ZED continuously scans its surroundings and creates a 3D map of what it sees\056 It updates this map as the device moves around and captures new elements in the scene\056 Since the camera perceives distances beyond the range of traditional RGB\055D sensors\054 it can quickly reconstruct 3D maps of large indoor and outdoor areas\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 8210 0 R
     /Pg 6716 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

