8359 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The ZED 2i stereo camera combines powerful hardware and intelligent software to create an unrivaled solution in terms of performance\054 functionality and design\056\240\n\nDesigned to function efficiently in harsh environments\054 the IP66\055rated ZED 2i stereo camera with its robust aluminum body withstands severe conditions with high particulate content\054 and water ingress\054 making it ideal for industrial applications such as agriculture\054 manufacturing\054 pharmaceuticals and many more\056\n\nThe ZED 2i covers the entire spectrum of applications from robotics and spatial analytics to interactive experiences\056\240\240)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 8360 0 R
     /Pg 7736 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
